# Guitar Freaks 7th Mix (G*B17 VER. JAA), Konami 2001: the first boot's install, from blank NVRAM (the game cassette
# in). No inputs: the CD installs itself to the onboard flash (two of its chips come filled with the set), then the 32 MiB PC Card in slot 1.
# By frame ~21900 it shows INFO 508: install done, note the certificate number and power-cycle.
# Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames, to compare HIRAKU's 573 core
# with MAME through the install.
game gtrfrk7m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

from 0 every 60 snap
at 22800 quit
